From 652775a785605e12e748ab3167f66281af758e33 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 20:19:51 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(cast): follow DLNA and Chromecast playback after casting

Poll DLNA position/transport state and read Chromecast MEDIA_STATUS on a
dedicated reader thread. Mirror the remote track, play state and progress
in the mini player and now playing screen, auto-advance the queue when a
track finishes (and follow renderer-driven SetNext changes), route seek to
Chromecast, and map hardware volume keys to the renderer volume.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FEDCezPFi51Bf5mkmoEhB4
